0..78 Comment "// A record type\'s faces refused: one face holds a label the record lacks, and"
79..159 Comment "// one face is named twice. A static bracket refused: it names a field or a face"
160..234 Comment "// that the record type lacks. Another bracket fixes a field at a value of"
235..310 Comment "// another type. A record literal at a patched type states a fixed field at"
311..328 Comment "// another value."
329..331 Comment "//"
332..411 Comment "// A face lists only labels its record holds, and each face has its own name. A"
412..491 Comment "// static bracket fixes only the fields its record type writes, and a face only"
492..566 Comment "// when the type member names it. Each refusal stands at the label, at the"
567..646 Comment "// second name or at the face, by its name. A fixed value has its field\'s type,"
647..727 Comment "// and the refusal stands at the value. A literal\'s fixed field is the value the"
728..782 Comment "// bracket fixes, and the refusal stands at the field."
783..785 Comment "//"
786..862 Comment "// The types stand in a module, whose members carry the verdict each refusal"
863..922 Comment "// states. Each refusal names the face and the record type."
923..925 Comment "//"
926..1008 Comment "// - see: `model/desc/record-faces.gandr` — the faces read, and the bracket read"
1009..1090 Comment "// - see: `pathological/desc/shaped-signature.gandr` — a theory\'s faces refused"
1091..1101 Comment "//   alike"
